<title>USA: BFGoodrich names David Burner chairman.</title>
<headline>BFGoodrich names David Burner chairman.</headline>
<dateline>RICHFIELD, Ohio 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>BFGoodrich Co on Monday said its president and chief executive officer David Burner has been elected chairman of the board to replace John Ong, who is retiring as chairman July 1.</p>
<p>The company said Burner will continue serving as president and chief executive. Burner became chief executive in December 1996, following his election as president a year earlier.</p>
<p>Ong has served as chairman since 1979, the company said. He joined the company in 1961.</p>
